#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:33
msgid ""
"The Azure storage account name which can be obtained by clicking the "
"\"Manage Access Keys\" button on the storage account dashboard."
msgstr "Azure 儲存賬戶名稱可以透過點選儲存賬戶儀表板上的\"Manage Access Keys\"按鈕獲得。"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:34
msgid "The storage account name"
msgstr "儲存帳戶名稱"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:35
msgid ""
"The Azure access key which can be obtained by clicking the \"Manage Access "
"Keys\" button on the storage account dashboard."
msgstr "Azure access key 可以透過點選儲存賬戶儀表板上的\"Manage Access Keys\"按鈕獲得。"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:36
msgid "The access key"
msgstr "access key"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:37
msgid ""
"The Azure shared access signature (SAS) token which can be obtained by "
"selecting the \"Shared access signature\" blade on the storage account "
"dashboard, or inside a container blade."
msgstr "Azure 共享訪問簽名（SAS）權杖可以透過在儲存賬戶儀表板上選擇\"Shared access signature\"，或者在容器內部獲得。"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:38
msgid "The SAS token"
msgstr "SAS token"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:39
msgid "No Azure access key or SAS token given"
msgstr "未提供 Azure access key 或是 SAS token"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:40
msgid "Specify the access tier"
msgstr "指定訪問層"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:41
msgid ""
"Use this option to specify the access tier. If this option is not used, the "
"server will choose a default access tier."
msgstr "使用此選項指定訪問層。 如果不使用此選項，伺服器將選擇預設訪問層。"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:42
msgid "The storage classes that are considered archive classes"
msgstr "被視為歸檔類的儲存類"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:43
msgid ""
"Use this option to specify what storage classes are considered archive "
"storage classes. With this option it is possible to allow lifecycle policies"
" to move data to cheaper storage classes and prevent Duplicati from "
"accessing archived data."
msgstr ""
"使用此選項指定哪些儲存類被視為歸檔儲存類。 透過此選項，可以允許生命週期策略將資料移動到更便宜的儲存類別，並防止 Duplicati 訪問存檔資料。"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:44
msgid "The number of retries for Azure operations"
msgstr "Azure 操作的重試次數"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:45
msgid ""
"Use this option to specify the number of retries for Azure blob operations. "
"Set to 0 to disable retries."
msgstr "使用此選項指定 Azure Blob 操作的重試次數。 設定為 0 以禁用重試。"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:46
msgid "The immutability policy mode"
msgstr "不變性策略模式"

#: Library/Backend/AzureBlob/Strings.cs:47
msgid ""
"Use this option to specify the immutability policy mode. The default is "
"'Unlocked'."
msgstr "使用該選項可指定不變性策略模式。預設為 \"未鎖定\"。"

#: Library/Backend/Filen/Strings.cs:26
msgid ""
"This backend can read and write data to Filen.io using its REST protocol. "
"Supported format is \"filen://folder/subfolder\"."
msgstr "該後端可以使用其 REST 協議向 Filen.io 讀取和寫入資料。 支援的格式為“filen://folder/subfolder”。"

#: Library/Backend/Filen/Strings.cs:27
msgid "Filen.io"
msgstr "Filen.io"

#: Library/Backend/Filen/Strings.cs:28
msgid "Optional 2-factor code"
msgstr "可選的雙重身份驗證（2FA）程式碼"

#: Library/Backend/Filen/Strings.cs:29
msgid ""
"The 2-factor code to use for authentication, leave empty if the account is "
"not MFA protected. Note that a new code must be provided by the user for "
"each authentication attempt."
msgstr ""
"用於身份驗證的雙重身份驗證（2FA）程式碼；如果賬戶未受多重身份驗證（MFA）保護，請留空。請注意，每次登入嘗試均需由使用者提供新的驗證碼。"

#: Library/Backend/Filen/Strings.cs:30
msgid "Optional API key"
msgstr "API key（可選）"

#: Library/Backend/Filen/Strings.cs:31
msgid ""
"The API key to use for authentication, which will work even if the account "
"is MFA protected. Obtain the API key via the Filen CLI tool."
msgstr "用於身份驗證的 API 金鑰，即使賬戶受 MFA 保護也有效。透過 Filen CLI 工具獲取 API 金鑰。"

#: Library/Backend/Filen/Strings.cs:32
msgid "Move to trash"
msgstr "移至垃圾箱"

#: Library/Backend/Filen/Strings.cs:33
msgid ""
"If set, files will be moved to the trash instead of being deleted "
"permanently."
msgstr "如果設定，檔案將被移至垃圾箱而不是永久刪除。"

