#: Library/Backend/Jottacloud/Strings.cs:28
msgid ""
"This backend can read and write data to Jottacloud using its REST protocol. "
"Allowed format is \"jottacloud://folder/subfolder\"."
msgstr ""
"此後端可以使用其 REST 協議讀寫 Jottacloud 的資料。允許的格式為 \"jottacloud://folder/subfolder\"。"

