#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:27
msgid "Secrets from environment variables"
msgstr "環境變數中的 Secrets"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:29
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads secrets from environment variables.\n"
"Example use:\n"
"    env:\n"
"\n"
"For environment variables, the lookup is case-insensitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"從環境變數中讀取 Secret。.\n"
"使用示例：\n"
"env:\n"
"\n"
"對於環境變數，查詢不區分大小寫。\n"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:39
msgid "Secrets from a file"
msgstr "檔案中的 Secrets "

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:41
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads secrets from a file\n"
"Example use:\n"
"    file://path/to/file?passphrase=secret\n"
"\n"
"The file should be a JSON-encoded object with the secrets as key-value pairs.\n"
"If the file is not encrypted with a passphrase, the passphrase parameter can be omitted.\n"
"The file must be encrypted with AESCrypt if encryption is desired.\n"
"For file-based secrets, the lookup is case-insensitive.\n"
"\n"
"If the file is encrypted, this provider can also write secrets back to the file.\n"
msgstr ""
"從檔案中讀取金鑰的金鑰提供程式\n"
"使用例項：\n"
"    file://path/to/file?passphrase=secret\n"
"\n"
"該檔案應是一個 JSON 編碼物件，金鑰內容為鍵值對。\n"
"如果檔案未使用口令加密，則可以省略口令引數。\n"
"如果需要加密，檔案必須使用 AESCrypt 加密。\n"
"對於基於檔案的加密，查詢不區分大小寫。\n"
"\n"
"如果檔案已加密，該提供程式還可以將機密寫回檔案。\n"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:53
msgid "The decryption passphrase"
msgstr "解密 passphrase"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:54
msgid "The passphrase to use for decrypting the file with secrets"
msgstr "passphrase 用於解密 secrets 檔案"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:59
msgid "Secrets from AWS Secrets Manager"
msgstr "來自 AWS Secrets Manager 的 Secrets "

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:61
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads and writes secrets from AWS Secrets Manager\n"
"Example use:\n"
"    aws://?access-key=...&secret-key=...&region-endpoint=us-east-1&secrets=secret1,secret2\n"
"\n"
"Either the region endpoint or the service URL must be provided.\n"
"Each secret is retrieved in the order specified until all requested keys are found.\n"
"Each secret must be a key-value pair type secret.\n"
msgstr ""
"從 AWS Secrets Manager 讀取和寫入金鑰的金鑰提供程式\n"
"Example use:  使用例項：\n"
"    aws://?access-key=...&secret-key=...&region-endpoint=us-east-1&secrets=secret1,secret2\n"
"\n"
"必須提供區域端點或服務 URL。\n"
"每個金鑰都按照指定的順序進行檢索，直到找到所有請求的金鑰。\n"
"每個金鑰必須是鍵值對型別的金鑰。\n"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:69
msgid "The AWS access key"
msgstr "AWS access key"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:70
msgid ""
"The access key to use for authentication with AWS. Can also be supplied via "
"the environment variable {envname}"
msgstr "用於 AWS 身份驗證的訪問金鑰。也可透過環境變數 {envname} 提供。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:71
msgid "The AWS secret key"
msgstr "AWS secret key"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:72
msgid ""
"The secret key to use for authentication with AWS. Can also be supplied via "
"the environment variable {envname}"
msgstr "用於 AWS 身份驗證的金鑰。也可透過環境變數 {envname} 提供。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:73
msgid "The AWS region endpoint"
msgstr "AWS region endpoint"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:74
msgid ""
"The region endpoint to use for communication with AWS. Can also be supplied "
"via the environment variable {envname}"
msgstr "用於與 AWS 通訊的區域端點。也可透過環境變數 {envname} 提供。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:75
msgid "The AWS service URL"
msgstr "AWS service URL"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:76
msgid ""
"The service URL to use for communication with AWS. Can also be supplied via "
"the environment variable {envname}"
msgstr "用於與 AWS 通訊的服務 URL。也可透過環境變數 {envname} 提供。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:77
msgid "The secret names to retrieve"
msgstr "要檢索的 secret 名稱"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:78
msgid ""
"The names of the secrets to retrieve from AWS Secrets Manager, separated by "
"semicolons or commas. Secrets are retrieved in the order specified until all"
" requested keys are found."
msgstr "要從 AWS Secrets Manager 檢索的金鑰名稱，用分號或逗號分隔。秘密將按指定順序檢索，直到找到所有請求的金鑰。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:79 Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:106
#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:205
msgid "Case sensitivity"
msgstr "大小寫敏感"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:80 Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:107
#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:206
msgid "Whether to use case-sensitive matching for secret names"
msgstr "是否對秘密名稱使用大小寫敏感匹配"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:85
msgid "Secrets from HashiCorp Vault"
msgstr "HashiCorp Vault Secrets"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:87
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads and writes secrets from HashiCorp Vault\n"
"Example use:\n"
"    hcv://localhost:1234?token=...&mount=secret&secrets=secret1,secret2\n"
"\n"
"The secrets parameter should be a comma- or semicolon-separated list of secret names to retrieve from the Vault.\n"
"Each vault secret is retrieved in the order specified until all requested keys are found.\n"
msgstr ""
"從 HashiCorp Vault 讀寫秘密的秘密提供者\n"
"使用示例：\n"
"    hcv://localhost:1234?token=...&mount=secret&secrets=secret1,secret2\n"
"\n"
"秘密引數應該是一個以逗號或分號分隔的列表，包含要從保險庫檢索的秘密名稱。\n"
"每個保險庫金鑰都按照指定的順序進行檢索，直到找到所有請求的金鑰。\n"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:94
msgid "The Vault token"
msgstr "Vault token"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:95
msgid "The token to use for authentication with HashiCorp Vault"
msgstr "與 HashiCorp Vault 進行身份驗證時使用的 token"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:96
msgid "The vault server protocol"
msgstr "保險庫伺服器協議"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:97
msgid "The protocol to use for communication with the Vault server"
msgstr "與 Vault 伺服器通訊時使用的協議"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:98
msgid "Secret entries"
msgstr "Secret 條目"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:99
msgid ""
"The names of the secrets (aka Vault Apps) to retrieve from the Vault, "
"separated by semicolons or commas. Secrets are retrieved in the order "
"specified until all requested keys are found."
msgstr "要從保險庫中檢索的金鑰（又稱保險庫應用程式）的名稱，用分號或逗號分隔。金鑰將按指定順序檢索，直到找到所有請求的金鑰。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:100
msgid "The client ID"
msgstr "client ID"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:101
msgid ""
"The client ID to use for authentication with HashiCorp Vault. Can also be "
"supplied via the environment variable {envname}"
msgstr "用於 HashiCorp Vault 身份驗證的客戶端 ID。也可透過環境變數 {envname} 提供。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:102
msgid "The client secret"
msgstr "client secret"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:103
msgid ""
"The client secret to use for authentication with HashiCorp Vault. Can also "
"be supplied via the environment variable {envname}"
msgstr "用於 HashiCorp Vault 身份驗證的客戶端金鑰。也可透過環境變數 {envname} 提供。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:104
msgid "The mount point"
msgstr "  掛載點"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:105
msgid "The mount point for the secrets in the Vault"
msgstr " HashiCorp Vault 中的金鑰掛載點"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:112
msgid "Secrets from Google Cloud Storage Secret Manager"
msgstr "Google Cloud Storage Secret Manager Secrets"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:114
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads and writes secrets from Google Cloud Storage Secret Manager\n"
"Example use:\n"
"    gcs://?project-id=...&version=latest\n"
"\n"
"If the access token is not supplied, the default GCS credentials from the machine will be used.\n"
"Use the accesstoken property to specify a custom access token.\n"
"Alternatively, you can supply service-account-json or service-account-file with Google Cloud service account credentials.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"從 Google 雲端儲存秘密管理器 讀取和寫入秘密的秘密提供程式\n"
"使用示例：\n"
"    gcs://?project-id=...&version=latest\n"
"\n"
"如果未提供訪問權杖，則將使用機器的預設 GCS 憑據。\n"
"使用 accesstoken 屬性指定自定義訪問權杖。\n"
"或者，您也可以提供包含 Google 雲服務帳戶憑據的 service-account-json 或 service-account-file 檔案。\n"
"\n"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:123
msgid "The API type to use"
msgstr "要使用的 API 型別"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:124
msgid "The type of API to use for communication with Google Cloud Storage"
msgstr "用於與 Google Cloud Storage 通訊的 API 型別"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:125
msgid "The GCP project ID"
msgstr "GCP 專案 ID"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:126
msgid "The ID of the Google Cloud Platform project to use for authentication"
msgstr "用於身份驗證的 Google 雲平臺專案 ID"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:127
msgid "The access token"
msgstr "access token"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:128
msgid ""
"The access token to use for authentication with Google Cloud Storage. If not"
" supplied, the default GCS credentials from the machine will be used."
msgstr "用於 Google Cloud Storage 身份驗證的訪問權杖。如果未提供，將使用機器的預設 GCS 憑據。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:130
msgid ""
"String with JSON credentials for a Google Cloud service account. When set, "
"access-token is not required."
msgstr "包含 Google 雲服務帳戶 JSON 憑據的字串。設定後，不需要訪問權杖。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:131
msgid "Service account JSON file"
msgstr "服務帳戶 JSON 檔案"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:132
msgid ""
"Path to a file with JSON credentials for a Google Cloud service account. "
"When set, access-token is not required."
msgstr "包含 Google 雲服務帳戶 JSON 憑據的檔案路徑。設定後，不需要訪問權杖。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:133
msgid "The secret version to get (or alias)"
msgstr "要獲取的 secret 版本（或別名）"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:134
msgid ""
"The version of the secret to retrieve from Google Cloud Storage. If not "
"supplied, the latest version will be used."
msgstr "要從 Google 雲端儲存中獲取的密文版本。如果未提供，將使用最新版本。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:139
msgid "Secrets from Azure Key Vault"
msgstr "Azure Key Vault Secrets"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:141
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads and writes secrets from Azure Key Vault\n"
"Example use:\n"
"    az://?keyvault-name=...&auth-type=ManagedIdentity\n"
"\n"
"If a client ID and secret are provided, use the auth type ClientSecret:\n"
"    az://?keyvault-name=...&auth-type=ClientSecret&tenant-id=...&client-id=...&client-secret=...\n"
"\n"
"If a username and password are provided, use the auth type UsernamePassword:\n"
"    az://?keyvault-name=...&auth-type=UsernamePassword&tenant-id=...&clientid=...&username=...&password=...\n"
"\n"
"If the vault-uri parameter is not provided, the keyvault-name parameter will be used to construct the URI.\n"
msgstr ""
"從 Azure 金鑰庫 讀寫秘密的秘密提供程式\n"
"使用示例：\n"
"    az://?keyvault-name=...&auth-type=ManagedIdentity\n"
"\n"
"如果提供了客戶端 ID 和秘密，請使用授權型別 ClientSecret:\n"
"    az://?keyvault-name=...&auth-type=ClientSecret&tenant-id=...&client-id=...&client-secret=...\n"
"\n"
"如果提供了使用者名稱和密碼，則使用認證型別 UsernamePassword:\n"
"    az://?keyvault-name=...&auth-type=UsernamePassword&tenant-id=...&clientid=...&username=...&password=...\n"
"\n"
"如果沒有提供 vault-uri 引數，將使用 keyvault-name 引數來構建 URI。\n"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:153
msgid "The name of the Azure Key Vault"
msgstr "Azure Key Vault 名稱"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:154
msgid "The name of the Azure Key Vault to use for retrieving secrets"
msgstr "用於檢索金鑰的 Azure 金鑰庫名稱"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:155
msgid "The connection type to use"
msgstr "使用的連線型別"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:156
msgid "The type of connection to use for communication with Azure Key Vault"
msgstr "用於與 Azure 金鑰庫通訊的連線型別"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:157
msgid "The URI of the Azure Key Vault"
msgstr "Azure Key Vault 的 URI"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:158
msgid "The URI of the Azure Key Vault to use for retrieving secrets"
msgstr "用於檢索金鑰的 Azure 金鑰庫 URI"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:159
msgid "The Azure tenant ID"
msgstr "Azure tenant ID"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:160
msgid "The ID of the Azure tenant to use for authentication"
msgstr "用於身份驗證的 Azure 租戶 ID"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:161
msgid "The Azure client ID"
msgstr "Azure client ID"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:162
msgid "The ID of the Azure client to use for authentication"
msgstr "用於身份驗證的 Azure 客戶端 ID"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:163
msgid "The Azure client secret"
msgstr "Azure client secret"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:164
msgid "The secret to use for authentication with Azure"
msgstr "用於 Azure 身份驗證金鑰"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:165
msgid "The Azure username"
msgstr "Azure 使用者名稱"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:166
msgid "The username to use for authentication with Azure"
msgstr "用於 Azure 身份驗證的使用者名稱"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:167
msgid "The Azure password"
msgstr "Azure 密碼"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:168
msgid "The password to use for authentication with Azure"
msgstr "用於透過 Azure 進行身份驗證的密碼"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:169
msgid "The authentication type to use"
msgstr "使用的驗證型別"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:170
msgid ""
"The type of authentication to use for communication with Azure Key Vault"
msgstr "與 Azure 金鑰庫通訊時使用的身份驗證型別"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:175
msgid "Secrets from macOS Keychain"
msgstr "MacOS Keychain Secrets "

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:176
msgid "Secret provider that reads and writes secrets from the macOS Keychain"
msgstr "可從 macOS 鑰匙串讀寫秘密的秘密提供程式"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:177
msgid "The service name"
msgstr "服務名"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:178
msgid "The service name to use for retrieving secrets from the macOS Keychain"
msgstr "用於從 macOS 鑰匙串中檢索金鑰的服務名稱"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:179
msgid "The account name"
msgstr "賬戶名"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:180
msgid "The account name to use for retrieving secrets from the macOS Keychain"
msgstr "從 macOS 鑰匙串中檢索金鑰時要使用的賬戶名"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:181
msgid "The type of password to get"
msgstr "要獲取的密碼型別"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:182
msgid "The type of password to get from the macOS Keychain"
msgstr "從 macOS 鑰匙串中獲取的密碼型別"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:187
msgid "Secrets from Unix pass"
msgstr "Unix pass Secrets "

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:188
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads and writes secrets from the Unix pass password "
"manager"
msgstr "從 Unix 通行證密碼管理器讀寫秘密的秘密提供程式"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:189
msgid "The pass command"
msgstr "pass command"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:190
msgid ""
"The command to use for retrieving secrets from the Unix pass password "
"manager"
msgstr "從 Unix 通行證密碼管理器中檢索金鑰時使用的命令"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:195
msgid "Secrets from Windows Credential Manager"
msgstr "Windows Credential Manager Secrets"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:196
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads and writes secrets from the Windows Credential "
"Manager"
msgstr "從 Windows 證書管理器讀寫秘密的秘密提供程式"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:201
msgid "Secrets from libsecret"
msgstr "Libsecret Secrets "

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:202
msgid ""
"Secret provider that reads and writes secrets from the libsecret password "
"manager"
msgstr "從 libsecret 密碼管理器讀寫秘密的秘密提供程式"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:203
msgid "The collection name"
msgstr "集合名稱"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:204
msgid ""
"The collection (keyring/wallet) name to use for retrieving secrets from the "
"libsecret password manager. Leave empty for the system default."
msgstr "用於從 libsecret 密碼管理器讀取金鑰的金鑰集合（鑰匙串 / 密碼庫）名稱。留空則使用系統預設集合。"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:207
msgid "Disable auto-create collection"
msgstr "禁用自動建立收藏集"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:208
msgid ""
"Disables the automatic creation of the collection if it does not exist when "
"accessing libsecret"
msgstr "訪問 libsecret 時，如果集合不存在，則禁止自動建立集合"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:209
msgid "The D-Bus service name"
msgstr "D‑Bus 服務名稱"

#: Library/SecretProvider/Strings.cs:210
msgid ""
"The D-Bus service name implementing the freedesktop Secret Service API."
msgstr "實現 freedesktop Secret Service API 的 D‑Bus 服務名稱。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:29
msgid "Another instance is running, and was notified"
msgstr "已有例項正在執行，且已被通知"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:30
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Failed to create, open or upgrade the database.\n"
"Error message: {0}"
msgstr ""
"無法建立、開啟或更新資料庫。\n"
"錯誤訊息: {0}"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:33
msgid "Display this help"
msgstr "顯示幫助"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:34
msgid ""
"Supported commandline arguments:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"支援的命令列引數：\n"
"\n"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:37
#, csharp-format
msgid "--{0}: {1}"
msgstr "--{0}: {1}"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:38
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Use this option to store some or all of the options given to the commandline"
" client. The file must be a plain text file, and UTF-8 encoding is "
"preferred. Each line in the file should be of the format --option=value. Use"
" the special options --{0} and --{1} to override the localpath and the "
"remote destination uri, respectively. The options in this file take "
"precedence over the options provided on the commandline. You cannot specify "
"filters in both the file and on the commandline. Instead, you can use the "
"special --{2}, --{3}, or --{4} options to specify filters inside the "
"parameter file. Each filter must be prefixed with either a + or a -, and "
"multiple filters must be joined with {5} "
msgstr ""
"使用此選項來儲存傳遞給命令列客戶端的部分或全部選項。該檔案必須是純文字檔案，推薦使用 UTF-8 編碼。檔案中的每一行應採用 "
"--option=value 的格式。使用特殊選項 --{0}和 --{1}分別覆蓋本地路徑和遠端目標 "
"URI。此檔案中的選項優先於命令列上提供的選項。您不能在檔案和命令列中同時指定過濾器。相反，您可以使用特殊的 --{2}，--{3}或--{4} "
"選項在引數檔案內指定過濾器。每個過濾器必須以+或-為字首，多個過濾器必須用 {5} 連線。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:39 CommandLine/CLI/Strings.cs:46
msgid "Path to a file with parameters"
msgstr "引數檔案的路徑"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:40
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Filters cannot be specified on the commandline if filters are also present "
"in the parameter file. Use the special --{0}, --{1}, or --{2} options to "
"specify filters inside the parameter file. Each filter must be prefixed with"
" either a + or a -, and multiple filters must be joined with {3}"
msgstr ""
"如果過濾條件已在引數檔案中給出，那麼就不能再在命令列中指定。使用特殊選項 --{0}, --{1}, 或 --{2} "
"來指定引數檔案中的過濾條件。每個過濾條件必須以 + 或 - 做字首且多個過濾條件必須用 {3} 連線"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:41 CommandLine/CLI/Strings.cs:42
#, csharp-format
msgid "Unable to read the parameters file \"{0}\", reason: {1}"
msgstr "未能讀取引數檔案 \"{0}\"，原因：{1}"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:43
msgid "Output log information to the file given"
msgstr "將日誌資訊輸出到給定的檔案。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:44
msgid "Determine the amount of information written in the log file"
msgstr "確定寫入日誌檔案的資訊量。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:45
msgid "Output log information to the console"
msgstr "將日誌資訊輸出到控制檯"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:46
msgid ""
"Activate portable mode where the database is placed below the program "
"executable"
msgstr "啟用便攜模式，其中資料庫放置在程式可執行檔案的下方。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:47
#, csharp-format
msgid "A serious error occurred in Duplicati: {0}"
msgstr "Duplicati 發生一系列錯誤：{0}"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:48
#, csharp-format
msgid "An error occurred on server tear down: {0}"
msgstr "伺服器拆除時發生錯誤：{0}"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:49
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Unable to start up. Perhaps another process is already running?\n"
"Error message: {0}"
msgstr "無法啟動。可能是另一個程序已經在執行？錯誤資訊：{0}"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:51 Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:92
msgid "Disable database encryption"
msgstr "禁用資料庫加密"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:52
#, csharp-format
msgid "Unsupported version of SQLite detected ({0}), must be {1} or higher"
msgstr "檢測到不支援的 SQLite 版本 ({0})，必需 {1} 或更高"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:53
msgid ""
"The path to the folder where the static files for the webserver is present. "
"The folder must be located beneath the installation folder."
msgstr "指向存放 Web 伺服器靜態檔案的資料夾路徑。該資料夾必須位於安裝資料夾之下。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:54
msgid ""
"The port the webserver listens on. Multiple values may be supplied with a "
"comma in between."
msgstr "Web 伺服器監聽的埠。可以使用逗號分割來指定多個值。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:55
msgid ""
"Deactivates the use of HTTPS even if a certificate is stored in the database"
" or provided on the commandline."
msgstr "停用 HTTPS，即使證書已儲存在資料庫中或透過命令列提供。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:56
msgid ""
"Removes any existing certificate from the database. This option also "
"disables HTTPS."
msgstr "從資料庫中刪除任何現有證書。該選項也會禁用 HTTPS。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:57
msgid ""
"The certificate and key file in PKCS #12 format the webserver use for SSL."
msgstr "web 伺服器用於 SSL 的 PKCS #12 格式的證書和金鑰檔案。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:58
msgid "The password for decryption of the provided certificate PKCS #12 file."
msgstr "用於解密所提供證書 PKCS #12 檔案的密碼。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:59
msgid ""
"The interface the webserver listens on. The special values \"*\" and \"any\""
" means any interface. The special value \"loopback\" means the loopback "
"adapter."
msgstr "Web 服務監聽的網路介面。特殊值 \"*\" 和 \"any\" 表示所有介面。特殊值 \"loopback\" 表示環回介面卡。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:60
msgid ""
"The password required to access the webserver. This option is saved so you "
"do not need to set it on each run. An access password is mandatory."
msgstr "訪問 Web 伺服器所需的密碼。此選項將被儲存，因此無需每次執行都進行設定。訪問密碼是強制要求的。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:61
msgid ""
"Access password feature for automated installation. Sets the password only "
"if not already set, and then exits."
msgstr "用於自動化安裝的訪問密碼功能。僅在密碼尚未設定時配置密碼，隨後程式退出。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:62
msgid ""
"The hostnames that are accepted, separated with semicolons. If any of the "
"hostnames are \"*\", all hostnames are allowed and the hostname checking is "
"disabled."
msgstr "逗號分隔有效的主機名。如果任何一個主機名設定為 \"*\"，那麼將禁用主機名檢查並接受所有主機名。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:63
msgid ""
"When running as a server, the service daemon must verify that the process is"
" responding. If this option is enabled, the server reads stdin and writes a "
"reply to each line read."
msgstr "當作為服務執行時，服務守護程序必須驗證程序是否響應。如果啟用此選項，伺服器會讀取標準輸入並對讀取的每一行回覆一個答覆。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:64
msgid "Enable the ping-pong responder"
msgstr "啟用乒乓響應器"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:65
msgid "Disable the automatic update check"
msgstr "禁用自動更新檢查"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:66
msgid ""
"Use this option to disable the automatic update check. Manual update checks "
"can still be performed."
msgstr "使用此選項禁用自動更新檢查。仍可進行手動更新檢查。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:67 Library/Main/Strings.cs:296
msgid "Set the time after which log data will be purged from the database."
msgstr "設定時長，在此時長之後日誌資料將被從資料庫中清除。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:68 Library/Main/Strings.cs:297
msgid "Clean up old log data"
msgstr "清理舊的記錄資料"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:69
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Duplicati needs to store a small database with all settings. Use this option"
" to choose where the settings are stored. This option can also be set with "
"the environment variable {0}."
msgstr "Duplicati 需要儲存一個存有所有設定的小資料庫。使用該選項來選擇設定儲存在哪裡。該選項也可以透過環境變數 {0} 進行指定。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:70
msgid "Set the folder where settings are stored"
msgstr "設定儲存設定的資料夾"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:71
msgid ""
"Allow the data folder to be placed in a shared location without restricting "
"the permissions to SYSTEM and Administrators. This bypasses the security "
"check that prevents using a world-readable folder for the database and "
"configuration. Only use this option if you understand the risks and have "
"restricted the permissions manually."
msgstr ""
"允许将数据文件夹放置在共享位置，且不限制“系统”和“管理员”的权限。此操作将绕过那项防止将数据库和配置文件夹设置为“所有人可读”的安全检查。仅当您了解相关风险并已手动限制了权限时，才应使用此选项。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:72
msgid ""
"Allow the data folder to be in a shared location without restricted "
"permissions"
msgstr "允许数据文件夹位于权限不受限制的共享位置"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:73
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"This option sets the encryption key used to scramble the local settings "
"database. This option can also be set with the environment variable {0}. Use"
" the option --{1} to disable the database scrambling."
msgstr "該選項設定用於加密本地配置資料庫的金鑰。該選項也可以透過環境變數 {0} 來設定。使用選項  --{1} 可以禁用資料庫加密。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:74
msgid "Set the database encryption key"
msgstr "設定資料庫加密金鑰"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:75 Library/Main/Strings.cs:105
msgid ""
"Use this option to supply an alternative folder for temporary storage. By "
"default the system default temporary folder is used. Note that also SQLite "
"will put temporary files in this temporary folder."
msgstr "使用此選項提供一個用於臨時儲存的替代資料夾。預設情況下使用系統預設的臨時資料夾。請注意，SQLite 也會將臨時檔案放在這個臨時資料夾中。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:76 Library/Main/Strings.cs:106
msgid "Temporary storage folder"
msgstr "暫存資料夾"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:77
msgid "Reset the JWT configuration, invalidating any issued login tokens"
msgstr "重置 JWT 配置，使任何已發出的登入權杖失效"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:78
msgid "Enable the use of long-lived access tokens"
msgstr "啟用長效訪問權杖"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:79
msgid "Disable the web interface and only allow API access"
msgstr "禁用網路介面，只允許訪問應用程式介面"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:81
msgid "Disable the use of signin tokens"
msgstr "禁用登入權杖"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:84
msgid ""
"The relative paths that should be served as single page applications, "
"separated with semicolons."
msgstr "應作為單頁應用程式提供的相對路徑，用分號隔開。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:85
msgid ""
"A list of CORS origins to allow, separated with semicolons. Each origin must"
" be a valid URL."
msgstr "允許的 CORS（跨域資源共享）源列表，用分號分隔。每個源必須是有效的 URL。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:86
msgid ""
"The timezone to use for the webserver. The timezone must be a valid timezone"
" identifier, such as \"America/New_York\" or \"UTC\". Common three-letter "
"abbreviations like \"CET\" are supported, but ambiguous in some cases."
msgstr ""
"網路伺服器使用的時區。時區必須是有效的時區識別符號，如 \"America/New_York \"或 \"UTC\"。支援常見的三個字母縮寫，如 "
"\"CET\"，但在某些情況下會產生歧義。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:87
msgid ""
"A list of pre-authenticated tokens, separated with semicolons. These can be "
"used in cases where the authentication is provided by a proxy. Each token "
"must be at least 10 characters and not contain extended characters. The "
"token must be provided by setting the header on each request to contain: "
"Authentication: PreAuth <token>"
msgstr ""
"預認證權杖列表，用分號分隔。適用於由代理提供身份驗證的情況。每個權杖長度必須至少為 10 個字元，且不得包含擴充套件字元。必須在每個請求的 Header"
" 中設定：Authentication: PreAuth 以提供權杖。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:88
msgid ""
"Disable the API extensions reported by the server. This will not disable the"
" functionality, but will not report the extensions in the API responses. Use"
" this option to degrade the server to a more basic API."
msgstr "禁用伺服器報告的 API 擴充套件。這不會禁用功能，但不會在 API 響應中報告這些擴充套件。使用此選項可將伺服器降級為更基礎的 API。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:89
msgid ""
"The duration of the refresh tokens issued by the server. This value "
"indicates how much time can pass without activity before the user is asked "
"to log in again. The value must be greater than zero and is capped at 30 "
"days."
msgstr "伺服器簽發的重新整理權杖有效期。該值表示在要求使用者重新登入前，允許處於非活躍狀態的最長時間。該值必須大於零，上限為 30 天。"

#: Library/RestAPI/Strings.cs:91
