#: Library/SourceProvider/Builtin/Strings.cs:26
msgid ""
"This backend can read and write data to an file based backend. Allowed "
"formats are \"file://hostname/folder\" and "
"\"file://username:password@hostname/folder\". You may supply UNC paths "
"(e.g.: \"file://\\\\server\\folder\") or local paths (e.g.: (win) "
"\"file://c:\\folder\", (linux) \"file:///usr/pub/files\"). Use the prefix "
"\"vss://\" or \"lvm://\" to create snapshot based folders."
msgstr ""
"此後端可讀寫基於檔案的後端資料。允許格式為 \"file://主機名/資料夾\" 和 \"file://使用者名稱:密碼@主機名/資料夾\"。你可以提供"
" UNC 路徑（例如：\"file://\\伺服器\\資料夾\"）或本地路徑（例如：Windows 的 "
"\"file://c:\\folder\"，Linux 的 \"file:///usr/pub/files\"）。使用字首 \"vss://\" 或 "
"\"lvm://\" 可建立基於快照的資料夾。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:26
msgid ""
"This module provides the industry standard ZIP compression. Files created "
"with this module can be read by any standard-compliant ZIP application."
msgstr "此模組提供行業標準 ZIP 壓縮。用此模組建立的檔案可以被任何符合標準的 ZIP 應用程式讀取。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:27
msgid "ZIP compression"
msgstr "ZIP 壓縮"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:28 Library/Main/Strings.cs:239
#, csharp-format
msgid "Use the option --{0} instead."
msgstr "使用選項 --{0} 代替。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:29
msgid ""
"This option controls the compression level used. A setting of zero gives no "
"compression, and a setting of 9 gives maximum compression."
msgstr "該選項控制壓縮級別。設定為 0 表示不壓縮，設定為 9 表示最大壓縮。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:30
msgid "Set the ZIP compression level"
msgstr "設定 ZIP 壓縮級別"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:31
#, csharp-format
msgid ""
"Use this option to set an alternative compressor method, such as LZMA. Note "
"that using another value than Deflate will cause the option --{0} to be "
"ignored."
msgstr "使用此選項設定替代的壓縮方法，例如 LZMA。請注意，使用 Deflate 以外的其他值將導致此選項 --{0} 被忽略。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:32
msgid "Set the ZIP compression method"
msgstr "設定 ZIP 壓縮方法"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:33
msgid ""
"The ZIP64 format is required for files larger than 4GiB. Use this option to "
"toggle it."
msgstr "對於大於 4GiB 的檔案，需要 ZIP64 格式。使用此選項來切換它。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:34
msgid "Toggle ZIP64 support"
msgstr "切換 ZIP64 支援"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:35
msgid ""
"ZIP64 support is now always enabled. This option is deprecated and will be "
"removed in a future version."
msgstr "ZIP64 支援現在已始終啟用。此選項已棄用，並將在未來版本中移除。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:36
msgid ""
"This option changes the compression library used to read and write files. "
"The SharpCompress library has more features and is more resilient where the "
"built-in library is faster. When Auto is chosen, the built-in library will "
"be used unless an option is added that requires SharpCompress."
msgstr ""
"該選項可更改用於讀寫檔案的壓縮庫。SharpCompress 庫的功能更多，彈性更大，而內建庫的速度更快。選擇自動時，將使用內建庫，除非新增了需要 "
"SharpCompress 的選項。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:37
msgid "Toggles the zip library to use"
msgstr "切換要使用的 zip 庫"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:43
msgid ""
"This module provides Tar+Zstd compression. Files created with this module "
"use the .tzstd extension and include an EOF header for fast random access."
msgstr "這個模組提供 Tar+Zstd 的壓縮方式。其建立的檔案使用“.tzstd”字尾，幷包括一個 EOF 頭加快隨機訪問。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:44
msgid "Tar+Zstd compression"
msgstr "Tar+Zstd 壓縮"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:45
msgid ""
"This option controls the compression level used. A setting of 1 gives the "
"fastest compression with the lowest ratio, and a setting of 22 gives maximum"
" compression."
msgstr "這個選項控制使用的壓縮級別。設定為 1 時代表最快壓縮速度和最低壓縮比，設定為 22 時則會最大程度地壓縮。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:46
msgid "Set the TarZstd compression level"
msgstr "設定 TarZstd 的壓縮級別"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:47 Library/Compression/Strings.cs:58
msgid ""
"Use this option to buffer file data in memory instead of temporary files "
"during compression. This increases memory usage but avoids disk I/O for "
"temporary files."
msgstr "透過這個選項來在壓縮過程中把檔案資料快取在記憶體中，而不是臨時檔案裡。這會增加記憶體佔用，但同時減少針對臨時檔案的磁碟讀寫。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:48 Library/Compression/Strings.cs:59
msgid "Use memory buffer instead of temp files"
msgstr "使用記憶體快取，而不是臨時檔案"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:54
msgid ""
"This module provides Tar+GZip compression. Files created with this module "
"use the .tgz extension and include an EOF header for fast random access."
msgstr "這個模組提供 Tar+Zstd 的壓縮方式。其建立的檔案使用“.tzstd”字尾，幷包括一個 EOF 頭加快隨機訪問。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:55
msgid "Tar+GZip compression"
msgstr "Tar+GZip 壓縮"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:56
msgid ""
"This option controls the compression level used. A setting of 1 gives the "
"fastest compression with the lowest ratio, and a setting of 9 gives maximum "
"compression."
msgstr "這個選項控制使用的壓縮級別。設定為 1 時代表最快壓縮速度和最低壓縮比，設定為 9 時則會最大程度地壓縮。"

#: Library/Compression/Strings.cs:57
msgid "Set the TarGzip compression level"
msgstr "設定 TarGZip 的壓縮級別"

